{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01654","headline":"杂曲歌辞 苦热行 · 僧齐己","name":"杂曲歌辞 苦热行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"离宫划开赤帝怒，喝起六龙奔日驭。\n下土熬熬若煎煮，苍生惶惶无处处。\n火云峥嵘焚泬寥，东皐老农肠欲焦。\n何当一雨苏我苗？爲君击坏歌帝尧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01654.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01654","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}